    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-19 05:43:17",
      "note": "Gooooood morning Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for Sunday. We are back to that classic Surf Season weather today. We’ll have a high of 57° and bright, sunny skies all day. The snow is going to be getting surfy again and skiing softer throughout the day. Today could be a great day to break out that Hawaiian shirt to ski in, but maybe just bring an extra layer for the early morning. It is day 3 of EDM Weekend at Plazapalooza! After you're done ripping it up, come get down to Foxtail and SkiiTour on the Plaza Deck. As a reminder, we have closed Chickadee Bowl for construction on a new lift. Please stay out of that area for the foreseeable future as getting smacked by a construction vehicle or falling in a ditch would not make for a great day. If you normally park at the top of Chickadee, the bypass road just further down Entry 4 makes for a good parking alternative. ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time. It's Surf Season at The Bird, so to quote that one surfer guy, \"drop in, just smack the lip, wapow.\" Go get pitted today. #GMTB",
